 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 1536,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixty-four map cells read by $4173 in the captured mode. Columns 8,15,24,30,35,41,50,58 translate to type ten with depth limit32 and nonnegative boundary flag. Other cells among these64 resolve to type zero for the bound lookup, with limit24 and negative boundary flag. The map repeats through mask $5E=$3F; this is a world-coordinate strip, not screen pixels or a full collision simulator."
  },
  {
   "address": 1854,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen translations of a map cell's low nibble. The captured type-four/five/seven/eight/nine/ten/eleven/twelve entries select type ten, while nibble two/three are negative; $4173 uses zero as their fallback depth-table index."
  },
  {
   "address": 1870,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen inclusive upper column bounds for $4115: 8,15,24,30,35,40,50,255 followed by255. Opening column41 therefore selects region six; opening35 selects region four. These regions select a route entry after the bank is chosen."
  },
  {
   "address": 1902,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen selectors for exit regions: first eight are three, then eight zeros. Selector at least three uses the shared PRNG high byte masked with $60, selecting bank offsets0,32,64,96. These numbers select an entry bank, not another room by themselves."
  },
  {
   "address": 1918,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bank-zero destination scenes, first eight three followed by zeros. Other banks' scene arrays begin $079E,$07BE,$07DE. Scene three is the captured Brick Hallway resource."
  },
  {
   "address": 1934,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen target entry numbers for bank zero, beginning8,34,28,24,38,2,11,43. Entry identifiers belong to the target scene; they are not scene numbers."
  },
  {
   "address": 1950,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bank-one destination scenes, first eight three followed by zeros, selected at offset32 from $077E."
  },
  {
   "address": 1966,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bank-one entry identifiers beginning35,27,22,40,3,12,44,9, selected at offset32 from $078E."
  },
  {
   "address": 1982,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bank-two destination scenes, first eight three followed by zeros, selected at offset64 from $077E."
  },
  {
   "address": 1998,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bank-two entry identifiers beginning25,21,41,5,2,34,11,37, selected at offset64 from $078E."
  },
  {
   "address": 2014,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Bank-three destination scenes, first eight three followed by zeros, selected at offset96 from $077E."
  },
  {
